    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      249.17,
      376.28,
      621.55
    ],
    "text": "Galle and Hambantota TAKE ACTION! The sea areas off the coasts extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Hambantota will be very rough at times with very strong gusty winds up to (60-70) kmph. Naval and fishing communities are advised not to venture into these sea areas, until further notice. The naval and fishing communities who are engaged in fishing and naval activities in the above sea areas are requested to be vigilant in this regard and be attentive to future forecasts issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
